name: Explicit goal guidance, frozen context input and budget-reader recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_guidance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | context-choice
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | generation
expect: Goal guidance: off
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 Choose and save an exact goal revision | missing-goal-choice
keys: b
require-live-snap: 25 Shown revision: 1 | goal-editor
expect: Original goal
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | goal-selected
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 Goal guidance: on | guidance-enabled
ask: Is guidance explicitly enabled for the selected goal, with a clear distinction between operator priorities and source evidence before any model request?
keys: t
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | calls-editor
type: 3
keys: Enter
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | review-editor
type: 2
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review: 2 | explicit-limits
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Goal guidance: frozen revision 1 | frozen-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_guidance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 Goal guidance is frozen | frozen-choice-refusal
keys: b
require-live-snap: 20 GOAL IN THIS CONTEXT PLAN | bound-goal
expect: Original goal
expect-not: Later replacement goal
resize: 160x48
live-snap: goal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: goal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: goal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: goal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: goal-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-5-40x12
ask: Can the operator read the exact frozen goal at six sizes and return to the same allowance draft, even after the current goal head changes?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Goal guidance: frozen revision 1 | allowance-restored
expect: Protected review: 2
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_guidance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Escape
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP | setup
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 15 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
paste-file: @ART/exact-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Original goal | frozen-goal-after-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_guidance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the original goal and frozen context plan, with no generation, provider reservations or source changes?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
